<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Index Us" description="The privacy approach for Index Us, a minimal, static-first AI publication.">
  <header class="shell page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 class="page-title">Collect less.</h1><p class="dek">Index Us uses Ahrefs Analytics to understand site traffic and how readers use the site. There is no account system or behavioural advertising.</p></header>
  <div class="prose"><h2>Current data use</h2><p>This website is served by Cloudflare, which may process basic network and security logs. Index Us does not currently set marketing cookies, run behavioural advertising or collect newsletter subscriptions.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>Ahrefs Analytics receives information about page views and link clicks, including the page URL, referring page, browser language and screen dimensions. We use this information to understand readership and improve the site.</p><h2>Policy updates</h2><p>This policy will be updated when our data use changes, including before introducing accounts or newsletter subscriptions.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
